h\n\nありがとうございます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@spicy_tsuna/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/196a6e8d/uploads/origins/f709f041-96d6-468e-a2f8-81a901d38f00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6ea5d776ac90809794c4d51fe1ccc39", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/196a6e8d/uploads/origins/f709f041-96d6-468e-a2f8-81a901d38f00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6ea5d776ac90809794c4d51fe1ccc39, https://si.imgix.net/196a6e8d/uploads/origins/f709f041-96d6-468e-a2f8-81a901d38f00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7be94541ea71cd8747566926bfbc1e0d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/196a6e8d/uploads/origins/f709f041-96d6-468e-a2f8-81a901d38f00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c7964db9d63a35c8338144c9297701a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクターを2人描いてくれませんか？彼らは悪魔のハンターです。\n\n1. Saiyuken: https://imgur.com/a/A7oKBDY\nは、この肌色を出すことは可能なのでしょうか？ https://imgur.com/Hu0mvfp\n\n2. 98: https://imgur.com/a/XcY4JRN", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@spicy_tsuna/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/78cfb000/uploads/origins/953b2c3d-ec42-4b91-9820-d82267ff9235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=651e0edc391db883a2e9e1ca3e82d387", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/78cfb000/uploads/origins/953b2c3d-ec42-4b91-9820-d82267ff9235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=651e0edc391db883a2e9e1ca3e82d387, https://si.imgix.net/78cfb000/uploads/origins/953b2c3d-ec42-4b91-9820-d82267ff9235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ced706783549d8c27ae379b3a528cf70 2x, https://si.imgix.net/78cfb000/uploads/origins/953b2c3d-ec42-4b91-9820-d82267ff9235?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6ca4ca5283ad8337f